// 5. [T=103] recoverChained processes the chain: intermediate imageHash match triggers snapshot bypass, skipping checkpoint validation for subsequent links (H4)
// 6. [T=104] Final chain link applies attacker-controlled imageHash, taking over the Wallet's signer configuration
// 7. [Assert] Verify attacker successfully updated the imageHash without legitimate checkpoint enforcement

contract AuditAgentPoC is ExtendedSessionTestBase {
    function test_exploit() public {
        // Fix: Set required environment variables for the test base setup
        vm.setEnv("SEQ_SDK_RPC_MIN_PORT", "8545");
        vm.setEnv("SEQ_SDK_RPC_MAX_PORT", "8545");

